ntirely deterministic, zero-overhead routing mechanism. It maximizes the "s=
parsity" of the network, ensuring that for any given token, 99% of the netw=
ork remains completely dark (consuming zero active power), while the 1% tha=
t fires is highly specialized.</p><h2 data-path-to-node=3D"16">3. Minimizin=
g Action via the Finsler-Randers Metric</h2><p data-path-to-node=3D"17">Sta=
ndard networks use isotropic distance metrics (Euclidean space), which mean=
s optimization involves wandering through a massive landscape where every d=
